## SKU Price

### SKU Price Eligibility Object Schema

The [SKU Price Eligibility Object Schema](#schema) defines the structure for the [SKU Price Eligibility](#col) column.

> **Preview:** The [SKU Price Eligibility Object Schema](#schema) defines a column of the SKU Price dataset, which is a preview in this version of FOCUS. While that dataset is a preview, this schema may change in the next version without a deprecation notice.

